## 2. Target Scope & Architecture

* **Target System:** FinPay Core Services (v1.2.0-rc)
* **Environment:** AWS Staging VPC (`us-east-1`)
* **Components Evaluated:**
  * External API Gateway / Reverse Proxy (TLS 1.3 Termination)
  * EKS Cluster Workloads (`Customer Service`, `Payment Processing Service`)
  * Identity Provider: Microsoft Entra ID (OIDC / OAuth 2.0)
  * Persistence Layer: Amazon RDS PostgreSQL & Amazon S3 Audit Logs

